{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, hope you're doing good. Wanted to share some amazing news - my partner is pregnant! We're so excited! It's been a while since we had a kiddo around."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-d75e0c611ca393deb35f9743", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.585577+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d75e0c611ca393deb35f9743", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d75e0c611ca393deb35f9743", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Congrats, Ev! That's great news! Parenthood is so amazing. How are you feeling about it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-ef4d191e05e9e412b5fea677", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.609205+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ef4d191e05e9e412b5fea677", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ef4d191e05e9e412b5fea677", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: So excited and a bit nervous! It's been a while since I had a toddler around but I'm really looking forward to it. Parenthood is so rewarding. I still remember when my first child was born, the joy was amazing. Looking forward to witness the miracle of life and build more memories with my family!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-f15f8c4c8cf1d265566df718", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.620600+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f15f8c4c8cf1d265566df718", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f15f8c4c8cf1d265566df718", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow, you're gonna be an amazing parent! Treasure those memories, they're truly special."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-1bd1368e9cde5fc44df49c7f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.636718+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1bd1368e9cde5fc44df49c7f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1bd1368e9cde5fc44df49c7f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks Sam! Absolutely. Talking of memories, I want to show you this. It's a collage of some of our top family memories. Each photo has an amazing moment - birthdays, holidays, vacations - so good to look back and recall all the great times we had."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-7ef5d7f0331b4060f96e63a5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.649550+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7ef5d7f0331b4060f96e63a5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7ef5d7f0331b4060f96e63a5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That's so lovely, Evan. Your family looks so happy. What's the story behind that sign in the center?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-23cdc82871503b7c573c9b77", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.666159+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "23cdc82871503b7c573c9b77", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "23cdc82871503b7c573c9b77", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Oh, that one? It's from our trip to Banff. We have this sign in the frame that says 'Bring it on Home' - it's our family's motto, always reminding us of the importance of togetherness, no matter where we are."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-2ded97e5ad26c004f1845f71", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.678714+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2ded97e5ad26c004f1845f71", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2ded97e5ad26c004f1845f71", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That's really touching, Evan. It's important to have something that keeps the family bond strong."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-3be27fbfddd359839d7716e0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.692446+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3be27fbfddd359839d7716e0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3be27fbfddd359839d7716e0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Absolutely, Sam. My family means the world to me. They're my rock. I'm looking forward to expanding our family and creating even more beautiful memories."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-4de635fcd45b9739f33c0363", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.703959+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4de635fcd45b9739f33c0363", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4de635fcd45b9739f33c0363", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That's wonderful to hear, Evan! It's clear how much you value your family. Are you thinking of any specific plans or events to add to that collage?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-076957e9ddc67a1454625ae1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.719853+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "076957e9ddc67a1454625ae1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "076957e9ddc67a1454625ae1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam! Yeah, we're planning a big family reunion next summer. It's going to be a blast and a perfect opportunity to add to our collage."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-2fd5e3c5bc968c615edd9f62", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.731395+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2fd5e3c5bc968c615edd9f62", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2fd5e3c5bc968c615edd9f62", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Sounds fantastic! If you need any tips on organizing such a big event, just let me know. I'm always here to support and celebrate your family's milestones."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-d7c308ef81bfe1e58c411fc4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.745617+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d7c308ef81bfe1e58c411fc4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d7c308ef81bfe1e58c411fc4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam! Your support means a lot. I'll keep you updated. Take care, bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-3875dc72dc197ae2a07b752e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.759479+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3875dc72dc197ae2a07b752e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3875dc72dc197ae2a07b752e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Take care, Evan! Can't wait to hear about it. Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-c026c2bcf448b4efc4cda3d0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.769428+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c026c2bcf448b4efc4cda3d0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c026c2bcf448b4efc4cda3d0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Bye Sam. I'll definitely keep you updated. Thanks for the kind words and support. Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_19-6214a7d808bc28e7306a80b4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:43.779429+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6214a7d808bc28e7306a80b4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6214a7d808bc28e7306a80b4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
